<title>USA: US corn, soyoil sold to unknown buyers - USDA.</title>
<headline>US corn, soyoil sold to unknown buyers - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private exporters reported the sale of 105,000 tonnes of U.S. corn and 20,000 tonnes of soybean oil to unknown buyers, Agriculture Department said Wednesday.</p>
<p>Both sales called for delivery in the current marketing year, which opened Sept 1.</p>
<p>By law, exporters are required to promptly report major sales but it sometimes can take a day or two for identity of buyers to become known.</p>
